{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231045","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231045","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1023104501:1":{"text":"こんにちは、ご老人。こちらにロリエットという若い女性はいらっしゃいますか？","source_cn":"你好，尊敬的长者，请问您是否认识一位名叫罗丽叶的年轻小姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74918745682F8919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023104502:1":{"text":"ロリエットって、あの隣村のジュミオと仲がいい女の子のことだね！","source_cn":"你们说的罗丽叶，是那个与邻村的朱密欧交往甚密的女孩吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84ED3D27F1BDFE29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023104503:1":{"text":"ええ、お二人は今も連絡を取り合ってるのですか？","source_cn":"没错，他们最近还保持着密切的联系吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE545506B2F0BC22E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023104504:1":{"text":"うーん、私もよく知らないねえ。ロリエットのお父さんは気難しい性格だから、あの人とは仲があまりよくないんだよ。","source_cn":"噢，这个我可就不大清楚了。毕竟罗丽叶的父亲脾气实在是有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36AB8EC70D676414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:热心的老人家":{"text":"熱心な老人","source":"热心的老人家","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}